WEBVTT

00:02.602 --> 00:05.264
Aw, come on! This isn't fair.

00:05.338 --> 00:08.933
You accidentally burn down a building,
and you get 120 hours of community service?

00:09.009 --> 00:11.443
- Now this says that I gotta work with kids.
- Yeah, me too.

00:11.511 --> 00:14.674
- I don't like kids. I don't wanna work with 'em.
- I don't have time for this.

00:14.748 --> 00:20.015
- Yeah, I have 248 hours of, uh...
- Interstate.

00:20.086 --> 00:22.520
Inter... Interstate.

00:22.589 --> 00:25.581
- Sanitation. Jesus Christ!
- What is that... What is that?

00:25.658 --> 00:28.559
- That's the guys with the orange vests who pick up trash.
- Orange vests.

00:28.628 --> 00:32.894
- Oh, my God! And then what is this about the A. A?
- Alcoholics Anonymous.

00:32.966 --> 00:35.400
- For...
- Oh, my God.

00:35.468 --> 00:37.959
- Six months.
- That is so unfair!

00:38.038 --> 00:40.598
What do you expect? Why would you
tell the judge you were drunk?

00:40.673 --> 00:42.607
- 'Cause I was drunk.
- But why would you say that?

00:42.675 --> 00:45.405
- I thought that would get me off the hook.
- That was dumb, wasn't it?

00:45.478 --> 00:48.413
I would rather pay a huge fine
than have to give back to the community.

00:48.481 --> 00:51.109
- Holy shit! Look at this bill!
- What?

00:51.184 --> 00:55.177
- Those mimosas were like eight bucks a pop, Charlie.
- Are you serious?

00:55.255 --> 00:58.418
- Well, you had like seven of'em.
- Uh-oh.

00:58.491 --> 01:00.584
- Bro, I'm not paying for your mimosas.
- No way!

01:00.660 --> 01:04.187
- I didn't even bring enough money for those.
- I don't have enough money.

01:04.264 --> 01:07.631
You don't have any money?
What are you... Are you serious?

01:07.700 --> 01:09.531
Ah! Ah!

01:44.370 --> 01:47.362
Good. Good. Good.
Go ahead. Go ahead.

01:53.513 --> 01:55.447
I know what it is.

01:55.515 --> 01:58.484
We can't go back.

02:03.890 --> 02:08.554
I fold. Deal me out. Hey.
Hey, gang, what's the action?

02:08.628 --> 02:13.327
- What's going on here?
- Asians love gambling.

02:13.399 --> 02:15.560
- You know these guys?
- Yeah. From 'Nam.

02:15.635 --> 02:17.933
- You were in Vietnam?
- Don't get excited, Mac, all right?

02:18.004 --> 02:20.302
He was in Vietnam 10 years ago
on a business trip.

02:20.373 --> 02:23.308
- Beautiful country.
- Dad, please get these guys out of here.

02:23.376 --> 02:25.344
- They're really weird and scary looking.
- Yeah.

02:25.411 --> 02:27.208
Hey, I own half this bar too.

02:27.280 --> 02:30.147
You can't just come in here
and start running our lives. It's not fair.

02:30.216 --> 02:32.377
- Wanna bet?
- What?

02:32.452 --> 02:34.943
- Would you like to bet on it?
- On what?

02:35.021 --> 02:37.615
- Whether or not it's fair?
- Sure. Bet on whatever.

02:37.690 --> 02:40.955
You know what? This is exactly why I don't
wanna work with him. You know what I mean?

02:41.027 --> 02:43.860
- Yes.
- Because you start doing crazy shit like this all the time...

02:43.930 --> 02:46.763
and making crazy bets about
absolutely nothing at all, Dad.

02:46.833 --> 02:50.633
If you don't go, me and Mac and Charlie,
we're gonna sell our portion of the bar.

02:50.703 --> 02:52.637
- No, we're not.
- No, that's not happening.

02:52.705 --> 02:55.299
- Just back me up on this.
- No, I can't really back you up.

02:55.375 --> 02:58.173
Why can't you just back me up on this?

02:58.244 --> 03:00.804
You guys...

03:06.686 --> 03:08.620
Screw this.
I'm out of here.

03:08.688 --> 03:10.849
That just blew my mind.
That was incredible.

03:13.259 --> 03:16.490
So today's speaker is David...

03:16.563 --> 03:19.225
for those of you
who are new to the program.

03:19.299 --> 03:22.234
I know a number of you
have heard David's story before.

03:22.302 --> 03:24.600
But a few of you haven't.
I'm sure you'll find David's story...

03:24.671 --> 03:26.866
has a lot of relevance
to your situation.

03:26.940 --> 03:30.205
Uh, anyway,
I'm gonna go ahead and...

03:30.276 --> 03:32.437
We have a late arrival here.

03:32.512 --> 03:35.538
Hi. Do you want
to introduce yourself?

03:35.615 --> 03:37.708
- Me?
- Mm-hmm.

03:37.784 --> 03:40.150
Oh. I'm Charlie.

03:40.220 --> 03:42.154
Hi, Charlie.

03:42.222 --> 03:45.123
- Here. Have a seat down front.
- Oh. No. Okay.

03:45.191 --> 03:48.285
I knew this would happen.
I'm not an alcoholic actually.

03:48.361 --> 03:50.955
Yeah, I'm only here
'cause I got a little drunk...

03:51.030 --> 03:54.693
and I threw a flaming bag of feces into
a building and I burnt it down a little bit.

03:54.767 --> 03:57.759
You know? But I wasn't
trying to burn it down.

03:57.837 --> 04:01.705
I was trying to make the place
smell real bad and get rid of this guy.

04:01.774 --> 04:04.743
So... This guy knows
what I'm talking about.

04:04.811 --> 04:07.336
Look, uh, Charlie,
the first step to recovery...

04:07.413 --> 04:09.643
is simply admitting
that you have a problem.

04:09.716 --> 04:11.741
I'm not an alcoholic,
so it's cool.

04:11.818 --> 04:14.343
He was drinking a beer
when he came in.

04:14.420 --> 04:17.116
Oh, my... Dude! Oh, dude,
how are you gonna...

04:17.190 --> 04:19.750
Really?

04:19.826 --> 04:22.226
I thought you were cool, man, like...

04:22.295 --> 04:24.263
I'm not gonna sell my piece of the bar.

04:24.330 --> 04:26.423
You're being
such a dick about this.

04:26.499 --> 04:28.592
What do you want me to do,
get another job?

04:28.668 --> 04:32.502
Well, try to think where I'm coming from
in all this. I'm coming from a selfish place?

04:32.572 --> 04:34.597
- Just shut your mouth.
- Can I help you?

04:34.674 --> 04:38.269
We are here as part of our community service.

04:38.344 --> 04:42.007
- Always a bunch of clowns.
- Excuse me?

04:42.081 --> 04:46.313
All right. We need volunteers
for our Sunday basketball league.

04:46.386 --> 04:48.786
You're gonna be coaching the teams.

04:48.855 --> 04:52.791
I got two positions left, so I'm gonna
have to put two of you together.

04:52.859 --> 04:55.487
Great. Dennis and I will coach a team.

04:57.530 --> 04:59.930
I think I'd rather split you two up.

05:05.071 --> 05:07.835
Charlie. Hi.

05:07.907 --> 05:12.310
Hey. Wow. I didn't know
you were in A.A.

05:12.378 --> 05:15.279
- Yeah.
- Where were you sitting?

05:15.348 --> 05:20.115
I, um, kind of slumped down in my seat when
I heard your name so you wouldn't see me.

05:20.186 --> 05:22.450
Right.

05:22.522 --> 05:24.319
Listen. I didn't realize
you were an alcoholic.

05:24.390 --> 05:27.655
It actually explains
a lot of your past behavior.

05:27.727 --> 05:29.661
Check this out.
I'm not an alcoholic.

05:29.729 --> 05:32.129
- See, I have to be here 'cause the court...
- Okay.

05:32.198 --> 05:34.598
- I threw this flaming bag of feces...
- Okay, okay, okay.

05:34.667 --> 05:37.363
You don't have to give me
explanations. I understand.

05:37.437 --> 05:39.735
I've maybe been
a little too judgmental of you.

05:39.806 --> 05:43.572
I mean, I know what it feels like
to have alcohol run your life.

05:43.643 --> 05:47.477
- Doesn't run my life.
- And I... I want to maybe help you.

05:48.915 --> 05:51.611
Are you saying you want
to go out on a date with me?

05:51.684 --> 05:53.743
- No. No, Charlie.
- No?

05:53.820 --> 05:56.448
I don't... I never want
to go out on a date with you.

05:56.522 --> 05:59.355
- Great.
- What I'm saying is...

05:59.425 --> 06:02.417
maybe I could...
be your sponsor.

06:02.495 --> 06:05.726
- Oh!
- But you can't ever hit on me.

06:05.798 --> 06:08.096
- No.
- Because that's never gonna happen.

06:08.167 --> 06:10.192
- Yeah, I heard. You said that.
- Okay.

06:10.269 --> 06:12.396
- So, sponsor. That's cool, yeah.
- Okay. Okay.

06:12.472 --> 06:15.066
- Well, I wrote down my phone number.
- Wow.

06:15.141 --> 06:18.804
Please. Please, Charlie. Please don't
make me regret giving this to you.

06:18.878 --> 06:21.210
No, absolute...
Absolutely not.

06:21.280 --> 06:25.512
No, this'll be a platonic
sponsor-sponsoree kind of a thing.

06:25.585 --> 06:27.644
Great.

06:27.720 --> 06:31.656
Oh. No shit!
I was so close.

06:33.826 --> 06:38.354
All right, kids, kids. Uh, why don't you
line up on this free throw line over here.

06:41.734 --> 06:45.795
All righty. Uh, you...

06:45.872 --> 06:49.831
you, you, you and you...

06:49.909 --> 06:51.843
come over here.

06:55.181 --> 06:59.140
All right. Now the rest of you kids
can go with those two losers right there.

06:59.218 --> 07:01.914
Whoa, whoa, whoa.
What the hell's goin'on over here?

07:01.988 --> 07:05.822
- Pickin' my team.
- No. No, y-you can't... you can't take all...

07:05.892 --> 07:07.792
- I can't pick the...
- You can't pick all...

07:07.860 --> 07:10.124
- What should I not pick?
- You know exactly what you've done, sir.

07:10.196 --> 07:12.926
- Okay, everybody back.
- Whoa, whoa, whoa! That's my team!

07:12.999 --> 07:15.399
- No, we're startin' over.
- All right. Fine. But I pick first.

07:15.468 --> 07:17.402
- Fine.
- You.

07:17.470 --> 07:19.404
- You.
- Uh, you.

07:19.472 --> 07:22.202
- You.
- You.

07:22.275 --> 07:25.506
Hey! Ho!
What's goin'on over here?

07:25.578 --> 07:28.274
- Pickin' teams.
- The teams are already picked.

07:28.347 --> 07:31.441
You two have the Ducks,
and you have the Wildcats.

07:31.517 --> 07:34.611
Ducks.

07:34.687 --> 07:38.714
Are you kidding me? Are...
You guys are the Wildcats?

07:38.791 --> 07:41.316
Jesus Chri...

07:41.394 --> 07:43.624
Is anyone absent?

07:43.696 --> 07:47.530
Anyone tall?
What are those, flip-flops?

07:50.136 --> 07:53.628
Jesus, kid.
Did you not wear shoes?

07:53.706 --> 07:57.107
You don't know?
Did anyone else not bring shoes?

07:59.579 --> 08:01.479
All right, kids.
Everybody take a knee.

08:01.547 --> 08:03.879
Go ahead and kneel.

08:03.950 --> 08:07.147
Apparently there is some confusion
as to who is the head coach here.

08:07.220 --> 08:09.586
Yeah, it could be a guy
who's never participated...

08:09.655 --> 08:11.623
in any kind of sporting
event ever.

08:11.691 --> 08:14.125
Yeah, or it could be a girl.
That's enough said, right?

08:14.193 --> 08:16.525
Mac and I are gonna play
a quick game to 21.

08:16.596 --> 08:18.723
And the winner
will be head coach.

08:18.798 --> 08:20.732
You guys might
want to pay attention...

08:20.800 --> 08:23.234
'cause you could probably learn
a thing or two from watching us.

08:23.302 --> 08:26.032
Absolutely. Try to remember
what she does wrong.

08:26.105 --> 08:28.073
That's the first thing.

08:31.577 --> 08:33.511
Terrible.
Take a lap.

08:36.282 --> 08:39.149
God awful.
Get goin'.

08:41.587 --> 08:45.887
Oh, that's a great shot, Chris. Come here.
You're gonna be the saving grace of this team.

08:45.958 --> 08:48.722
Everybody try to be
a little bit more like Chris.

08:51.831 --> 08:54.994
- What the hell is that?
- I don't know.

08:55.067 --> 08:57.661
- It's diet.
- Oh.

08:57.737 --> 09:00.672
Do I look like I need
to be on a diet?

09:00.740 --> 09:03.038
I don't know.

09:03.109 --> 09:06.272
Terrible.
Take a lap.

09:12.251 --> 09:16.017
This one? Gonna get it this time?

09:17.623 --> 09:20.148
See, kids, that's 18-0.

09:20.226 --> 09:22.694
Fundamentals don't mean shit
if you got no strength.

09:22.762 --> 09:25.731
- My knee hurts.
- We're almost done.

09:25.798 --> 09:29.234
Oh, God. You son of a bitch.

09:37.877 --> 09:40.573
So this is your place?
Wow!

09:40.646 --> 09:43.479
You know, it actually looks
a lot like my apartment.

09:43.549 --> 09:45.608
- Don't sit on my bed.
- No. No. Wasn't gonna.

09:45.685 --> 09:49.143
That's a good bed though.
That's a beautiful bed. Nice and soft.

09:49.222 --> 09:53.454
Charlie, are you here
to try to have sex with me?

09:55.161 --> 09:58.858
I can't believe you could ask me
a question like that in my time of need.

09:58.931 --> 10:00.728
I'm sorry.

10:00.800 --> 10:04.167
That's okay. We... We got a history,
and you're suspicious.

10:04.237 --> 10:07.673
I get that. We got a crazy history,
you and me. Oh, well.

10:07.740 --> 10:11.403
You know, maybe I'll just...
maybe I'll just get a little comfortable...

10:11.477 --> 10:14.241
and I won't talk,
and you can just kinda...

10:14.313 --> 10:17.441
- Just watch your feet on the...
- tell me about...

10:17.517 --> 10:20.714
- I'll take my shoes off.
- No. Just don't take your shoes off.

10:20.786 --> 10:23.550
I'm really more comfortable
if I take my shoes off.

10:23.623 --> 10:25.614
- Charlie.
- So tell me about you.

10:25.691 --> 10:29.422
What kind of music are you into?
What's your favorite color?

10:29.495 --> 10:32.521
You ever... You ever owned a dog?
Do you want a dog?

10:34.400 --> 10:37.130
This thing is cozy.

10:37.203 --> 10:39.364
Just ice it
and it will go down.

10:39.438 --> 10:42.168
- I know what you do to it!
- Hey, what's the action?

10:42.241 --> 10:45.301
Oh, Jesus Christ! Are you gonna keep
saying that? Is that your catch phrase now?

10:45.378 --> 10:48.472
- Dad, can you please get me some ice?
- What happened to your eye?

10:48.548 --> 10:51.381
Well, Mac plays basketball
with his elbows. That's what happened.

10:51.450 --> 10:52.883
Youse were all playin' basketball?

10:52.952 --> 10:55.216
Yeah. It's a part
of our community service.

10:55.288 --> 10:58.849
Gotta coach kids.
It's part of our, uh, sentence.

10:58.925 --> 11:01.325
Like two teams playin'
against each other?

11:01.394 --> 11:03.453
Yeah, that's generally
how basketball is played.

11:03.529 --> 11:07.056
Basketball, huh? Here.

11:07.133 --> 11:10.398
And go! Very nice.

11:10.469 --> 11:13.495
Lot of tight footwork.
That's it. Very good.

11:13.573 --> 11:16.201
Chris, doin' really good.
You got some good moves.

11:16.275 --> 11:18.334
Dad, what the hell
are you doing here?

11:18.411 --> 11:21.380
Oh, well, I just came because
you were late. I volunteered.

11:21.447 --> 11:24.211
- Hey, do some ball work.
- Why are you doing this to me?

11:24.283 --> 11:27.980
I figured maybe you and I could do
a little father-son bonding.

11:28.054 --> 11:32.252
- I don't wanna bond with you. Go back to bonding with Charlie.
- Charlie's with a girl.

11:32.325 --> 11:34.225
- What girl?
- You know, the waitress girl.

11:34.293 --> 11:36.261
- The waitress hates Charlie.
- How do you know that?

11:36.329 --> 11:39.025
Because he's obsessed with her
and won't leave her alone.

11:39.098 --> 11:43.125
Quite frankly, I don't see what all the fuss
is about. I banged her. I don't get it.

11:43.202 --> 11:45.534
Dennis, you shouldn't be sleeping
with your friends' girlfriends.

11:45.605 --> 11:48.836
What, are you handing down life lessons?
Get the hell outta here! Get off my court!

11:48.908 --> 11:50.842
- What? Your court?
- Yeah.

11:50.910 --> 11:52.901
- Wanna shoot for it? Free throws?
- Shoot for what?

11:52.979 --> 11:55.743
Throw me the ball.
All right.

11:55.815 --> 11:58.909
Well, best out of three
gets to be the coach.

11:58.985 --> 12:02.011
- Dad, you don't wanna shoot me for it, because you'll lose.
- You wanna bet?

12:02.088 --> 12:04.488
Okay, kids, keys to the game.

12:04.557 --> 12:07.549
Elbows. Knees.
Say it with me once. Ready?

12:07.627 --> 12:09.527
Elbows. Knees.

12:09.595 --> 12:13.258
Excellent. Excellent work. Now you're
gonna want to utilize both of those...

12:13.332 --> 12:15.266
over the course of the season, okay?

12:15.334 --> 12:17.666
Because the referees in this
league aren't gonna call 'em.

12:17.737 --> 12:21.173
But they might, which is why
you have to be very careful.

12:21.240 --> 12:24.573
Fouls can lose a game for even
the most dominant of teams.

12:24.644 --> 12:28.774
Yeah, kids, could you excuse
the assistant coach and I for a second?

12:28.848 --> 12:30.816
We'll be back.

12:32.251 --> 12:35.049
Don't you ever contradict me
in front of my team like that.

12:35.121 --> 12:37.214
These kids need to know
who their coach is.

12:37.289 --> 12:40.122
Well, I can see how they might be confused.
Are those combat boots?

12:40.192 --> 12:44.151
Don't get all high-and-mighty because
you got a pantsuit. You look like Big Bird!

12:44.230 --> 12:47.222
I got the season schedule right here.

12:47.299 --> 12:49.597
- Get back! I can handle this.
- I have to see.

12:49.669 --> 12:53.332
- What's up?
- Why are you here?

12:53.406 --> 12:55.636
- I'm coaching Dennis's team.
- Not coaching my team.

12:55.708 --> 12:58.199
- You lost fair and square.
- Don't give a shit.

12:58.277 --> 13:00.472
Oh, it is on!
We play you guys first!

13:00.546 --> 13:03.242
- We are gonna school your sorry-ass team!
- Wanna make it interesting?

13:03.315 --> 13:05.374
Dad, you don't wanna do that.
Our kids are terrible.

13:05.451 --> 13:08.318
- That's what a bad coach would say.
- A hundred bucks says we win.

13:08.387 --> 13:11.652
- You're on. I'm gonna coach the shit out of this team.
- Well, assistant coach.

13:11.724 --> 13:13.954
- Let's make it 200.
- How about five, bitch?

13:14.026 --> 13:16.654
- What are you doing?
- You scared? You wanna quit? You can back out.

13:16.729 --> 13:19.721
'Cause I can coach this team
better than you or Dennis or Dad...

13:19.799 --> 13:21.926
or any other goddamn man
any day of the week.

13:22.001 --> 13:25.129
Whoo! Whoo!
That's it! Gambling!

13:29.341 --> 13:32.640
Oh, I can't tell you
how great I'm feeling.

13:32.712 --> 13:35.306
I haven't been this healthy
in, like, a crazy long time.

13:35.381 --> 13:37.406
It's having amazing effects
on my body.

13:37.483 --> 13:41.283
- That's probably the best thing about it.
- Yeah. Wow.

13:41.353 --> 13:44.618
So you can probably stop coming
over here all the time then, huh?

13:44.690 --> 13:48.558
Uh, well, I don't know.
I just don't know if that's safe.

13:48.627 --> 13:51.960
- Yeah, I think it's safe.
- Maybe if you think it's safe, I'll consider it.

13:52.031 --> 13:55.159
But whoo...

13:55.234 --> 14:00.103
Hey, um, how's
your friend Dennis?

14:00.172 --> 14:02.072
- Hmm?
- I haven't seen him around much lately.

14:02.141 --> 14:04.200
What...
What's he up to?

14:04.276 --> 14:07.404
He's, like, working at some
stupid youth center thing.

14:07.480 --> 14:11.109
- He works with kids?
- Yeah. But he has to. That's why.

14:11.183 --> 14:14.880
Oh, my God.
That is so sweet.

14:14.954 --> 14:17.354
Do you think maybe we
could go down and see him?

14:17.423 --> 14:19.516
Why don't we roll
down there today?

14:19.592 --> 14:22.584
You know, you and me.
Celebrate the three days sober.

14:22.661 --> 14:24.686
Great.
I'll get changed.

14:24.764 --> 14:27.460
Great.

14:27.533 --> 14:29.364
So get out.

14:29.435 --> 14:32.427
Actually I probably need to take a shower,
'cause I'm crazy sweaty from those.

14:32.505 --> 14:34.029
Charlie.

14:34.106 --> 14:36.472
I'm an alcoholic
trying to get better...

14:36.542 --> 14:38.567
and I'm getting
kicked out on the street.

14:38.644 --> 14:41.613
All right. Jesus.
You can start.

14:41.680 --> 14:43.705
These are wristbands...

14:43.783 --> 14:46.274
and these are safety pins.

14:46.352 --> 14:50.345
I want everybody to insert their
safety pin into their wristband...

14:50.422 --> 14:52.390
sharp side out.

14:52.458 --> 14:56.588
All right, if you come down right on the top
part and smash down with all your weight...

14:56.662 --> 14:59.062
you'll break the kid's foot
in three places.

14:59.131 --> 15:01.531
What if I get hurt?

15:01.600 --> 15:04.535
That's a good question.
Now as long as you hurt the other kid...

15:04.603 --> 15:07.163
as bad or worse than he hurts you...

15:07.239 --> 15:11.175
you'll have done your job,
and I'll be proud of you.

15:11.243 --> 15:14.770
Look how good he is
with those kids.

15:14.847 --> 15:17.816
You like that, huh?

15:17.883 --> 15:20.909
Tell you what.
I'll be right back.

15:22.988 --> 15:26.719
Okay, here we go. Lay it up.

15:26.792 --> 15:30.091
Shoot it up. Let's see.
Whoo. Very nice.

15:30.162 --> 15:34.189
Okay, everybody take five. Chris, come on
over here a minute. I'm gonna talk to you.

15:34.266 --> 15:38.066
Let's see. Go on over there.
You go... You guys go.

15:38.137 --> 15:41.470
Now listen. Clearly, you're
the best player on the team.

15:41.540 --> 15:44.100
All right? Now I wanna
give you a couple lessons...

15:44.176 --> 15:47.475
that maybe Coach Dennis
hasn't covered with you.

15:47.546 --> 15:51.277
Lesson number one:
Winnin' ain't everything.

15:51.350 --> 15:56.151
Lesson two:
Do you own a bike?

15:57.990 --> 16:00.015
Hey.

16:00.092 --> 16:02.287
- Dennis, hey.
- Hey.

16:02.361 --> 16:04.727
I haven't seen you in a while.

16:04.797 --> 16:07.129
You haven't come by
the coffee shop.

16:07.199 --> 16:11.397
Uh, yeah.

16:11.470 --> 16:16.737
Um, so I know that it was kind of...
it got weird after the...

16:16.809 --> 16:19.539
- Right.
- When we...

16:19.612 --> 16:21.876
Um, anyway...

16:21.947 --> 16:25.849
I thought maybe we could spend
some time together again.

16:25.918 --> 16:30.412
Um, haven't you been spending
a lot of time with Charlie lately?

16:30.489 --> 16:32.457
I'm helping him get sober.

16:32.524 --> 16:35.925
Right. Well, good.
That's a good thing.

16:35.995 --> 16:37.929
- Thank you.
- Yeah.

16:37.997 --> 16:40.431
- So I don't want to get in the middle of that.
- Oh.

16:40.499 --> 16:44.401
So we shouldn't talk at all
while that's going on.

16:44.470 --> 16:47.200
Oh.

16:47.273 --> 16:49.400
Good. All right.
I'll see you.

16:49.475 --> 16:51.375
Wha... You will see me.

16:51.443 --> 16:54.901
- I'll see you.
- Yep, yep, yep, yep.

16:54.980 --> 16:58.381
- Charlie, this isn't working out.
- Huh?

16:58.450 --> 17:02.250
I don't wanna be your sponsor anymore. It's
starting to get in the way of my personal life.

17:02.321 --> 17:06.519
What are you talkin' about?

17:06.592 --> 17:09.186
I only offered
to be your sponsor...

17:09.261 --> 17:11.957
so I could get closer
to your friend Dennis.

17:13.332 --> 17:15.892
- What? Dennis?
- Yeah.

17:15.968 --> 17:19.870
Come on! That guy, he's
like one of those cheesy...

17:19.939 --> 17:23.272
Oh, he's so phony. No. You know what?
We can't do this action.

17:23.342 --> 17:26.607
You gotta... 'Cause what
if I start drinking again?

17:26.679 --> 17:29.204
That's a risk
I'm willing to take.

17:32.051 --> 17:33.985
I hope you guys
are ready for the pain.

17:34.053 --> 17:36.453
Oh, we'll be bringing
a little pain of our own.

17:36.522 --> 17:39.457
- You guys are goin' down.
- We'll see.

17:39.525 --> 17:42.085
- All right, kids, how are you feelin'?
- Good.

17:42.161 --> 17:45.028
Good? Doesn't sound good.
Are you drinking the Red Bull?

17:45.097 --> 17:47.327
- Come on. Chug 'em down.
- I feel sick.

17:47.399 --> 17:50.800
That's the vitamins ripping out the inside
of your stomach. That's a good thing. Trust me.

17:50.869 --> 17:53.565
Flop, come here for a second.

17:56.508 --> 17:59.409
All right.
These are for you.

17:59.478 --> 18:03.073
And there's a steel toe in there.
Don't be afraid to use it.

18:03.148 --> 18:05.275
- Thanks, Dad.
- I'm not your dad.

18:05.351 --> 18:07.751
All right. Let's get
this show on the road.

18:07.820 --> 18:10.983
All right, Team Wildcats!
Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!

18:11.056 --> 18:14.184
All right, boys. Now listen up.
This week... Where's Chris?

18:14.259 --> 18:17.854
- Uh, I don't know.
- You don't know? You guys know where Chris is?

18:17.930 --> 18:20.626
- No.
- Ah, it's no big deal. We don't need him.

18:20.699 --> 18:23.896
It is a big deal. We can't play without Chris.
I got 500 bucks on this game.

18:23.969 --> 18:25.903
- Are you crazy?
- Well, let's...

18:25.971 --> 18:28.769
- I gotta find him. We can't play without him.
- No. You can't go.

18:28.841 --> 18:31.435
- He lives a block away. I'll be right back.
- Dennis, where...

18:31.510 --> 18:34.411
- I'll be right back.
- Let's go. Get ready. Put your shoes on.

18:35.748 --> 18:39.707
Hey, Chris, you in there?
Chris, come on, buddy. Let's go.

18:39.785 --> 18:42.777
Hey.

18:42.855 --> 18:45.585
What the hell are you doing?
The game's about to start.

18:45.657 --> 18:48.626
- I got a new bike.
- So ride your bike after the game.

18:48.694 --> 18:52.289
- I'm not supposed to play.
- What do you mean, you're not supposed to play?

18:52.364 --> 18:56.027
You know what? I don't
have to talk to you, shithead!

18:58.003 --> 19:01.734
You bought Chris a new bike
to throw the game. The bet's off.

19:01.807 --> 19:04.503
- Whoa!
- You can't call the bet off.

19:04.576 --> 19:07.136
- Dad's up to something.
- I'm not up to nothing.

19:07.212 --> 19:09.203
- Excuse me. Hey, Dennis.
- Yeah?

19:09.281 --> 19:12.114
Hey, um, just... I want...
Just good luck out there.

19:12.184 --> 19:14.209
Okay, yeah.
What are you talking about?

19:14.286 --> 19:16.846
- I just wanted to say good luck.
- All right. Great. Thanks.

19:16.922 --> 19:20.016
Um, why don't you have a seat on the
bleachers? I'm in the middle of something.

19:20.092 --> 19:24.586
No way. I'm not sitting up there.
It's way too smoky.

19:32.571 --> 19:35.802
You cheating piece of shit.

19:35.874 --> 19:39.332
Oh, let's go!

19:39.411 --> 19:41.902
Let's... Let's play
some basketball, all right?

19:41.980 --> 19:44.278
- Charlie, what are you doing?
- I volunteered.

19:44.349 --> 19:46.476
- Let's play some ball.
- Oh, my God.

19:46.552 --> 19:48.986
You know what, man?
You gotta call this game off.

19:49.054 --> 19:51.989
Oh, you're dead to me. There's a dead man
speaking to me right here.

19:52.057 --> 19:53.581
- Great. You're drunk.
- I'm dead to you?

19:53.659 --> 19:56.025
Yeah, I am drunk.
You know why?

19:56.095 --> 19:59.121
- I don't have a sponsor anymore!
- Whatever, Charlie.

19:59.198 --> 20:01.689
- Let's play basketball!
- You gotta call this game off, Charlie!

20:01.767 --> 20:04.895
- Let's have the teams! Let's play ball!
- Let's play.

20:04.970 --> 20:06.870
You're not gonna get away
with this, Dad.

20:06.939 --> 20:09.407
I haven't got a clue what you're talking about.

20:25.824 --> 20:29.624
Get him with the elbow!

20:55.387 --> 20:57.878
What the hell are you doing?

21:07.666 --> 21:12.035
Hey, hey.
Right?

21:26.485 --> 21:29.682
All right, Charlie, that's it!

21:29.755 --> 21:31.985
You call this game!
This game is over!

21:32.057 --> 21:34.924
- You got a problem? Button that lip!
- Don't tell me to button my lip!

21:34.993 --> 21:36.927
- Is that a threat?
- Yeah, that's a threat!

21:36.995 --> 21:39.327
- You're outta here!
- Charlie, what are you doing?

21:39.398 --> 21:41.832
- I call 'em like I see 'em.
- Come on, man. Calm down.

21:41.900 --> 21:43.800
- You're outta here!
- Oh, my God!

21:43.869 --> 21:45.860
- Yes! I'm head coach!
- This is your fault, Dad!

21:45.938 --> 21:48.236
- Why is it my fault?
- Because you fixed the game!

21:48.307 --> 21:50.707
- You fixed the game?
- What are you talking about?

21:50.776 --> 21:53.506
- Yes, he fixed the game!
- What are you talking about?

21:53.579 --> 21:55.911
How do you do
something like that?

21:55.981 --> 21:59.109
Do you see what you've done?

21:59.184 --> 22:01.175
Get out ofhere!
You're in the showers!
